WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:20.961
The library port is already underway.

00:20.961 --> 00:39.361
Reuse the mathematics. Check the evidence.

00:39.361 --> 00:59.361
The first bridge is real.

00:59.361 --> 01:22.228
Three real Lean proofs, checked.

01:22.228 --> 01:41.495
